
# 💜 VibeTok

### Your World. Your Vibe.

VibeTok is a global social media platform designed to bring people together through short videos, live streaming, creativity, entertainment, and communication.

## 🌍 Our Mission

To connect people worldwide, empower creators, encourage creativity, and create opportunities for everyone to grow and earn.

## 🚀 Features

- Short video sharing
- Live streaming
- User profiles and profile banners
- Custom profile themes
- Private messaging
- Voice and video calls
- Video editing
- Stories
- Communities
- AI-powered discovery
- Virtual gifts
- Creator rewards
- Creator subscriptions
- Verified accounts
- Video playlists
- Multi-language support

## 🎨 Design

VibeTok uses a modern black-and-purple design to create a unique and exciting social experience.

## 📱 Platform

- iOS
- Android
- Global community

## 🛠️ Technology

- React Native
- Expo
- TypeScript
- Expo Router

## 🔮 Future Development

We aim to build a secure, entertaining, and creator-friendly platform where people can connect, share their talents, and grow worldwide.

